helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03100100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150616				0	et	\<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/03100100.xhp\" name=\"CBool funktsioon [Käitusaeg]\"\>CBool funktsioon [Käitusaeg]\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03100100.xhp	0	help	par_id3145136				0	et	Converts a string comparison or numeric comparison to a Boolean expression, or converts a single numeric expression to a Boolean expression.				20200411 15:09:53
