helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080103.xhp	0	help	par_id3149456				0	et	Returns the sine of an angle. The angle is specified in radians. The result lies between -1 and 1.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080103.xhp	0	help	par_id3153379				0	et	Using the angle Alpha, the Sin Function returns the ratio of the length of the opposite side of an angle to the length of the hypotenuse in a right-angled triangle.				20200411 15:09:53
