helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080101.xhp	0	help	par_id3156212				0	et	\<emph\>Number:\</emph\> Any numerical expression that represents the ratio of two sides of a right triangle. The Atn function returns the corresponding angle in radians (arctangent).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080101.xhp	0	help	par_id3153192				0	et	Radiaanide teisendamiseks kraadidesse korruta radiaanid 180/pii.				20200411 15:09:53
