helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120306.xhp	0	help	par_id3148473				0	et	Returns the specified portion of a string expression (\<emph\>Mid function\</emph\>), or replaces the portion of a string expression with another string (\<emph\>Mid statement\</emph\>).				20200411 15:09:53
