helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030102.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156344				0	et	\<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/03030102.xhp\" name=\"DateValue funktsioon [Käitusaeg]\"\>DateValue funktsioon [Käitusaeg]\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030102.xhp	0	help	par_id3150542				0	et	Returns a date value from a date string. The date string is a complete date in a single numeric value. You can also use this serial number to determine the difference between two dates.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03030102.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148799				0	et	Süntaks:				20200411 15:09:53
