helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01020300.xhp	0	help	par_id3154486				0	et	The variable retains its value until the next time the FUNCTION or SUB is entered. The declaration must exist inside a SUB or a FUNCTION.				20200411 15:09:53
