helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120401.xhp	0	help	par_id3153126	9			0	et	\<emph\>Start: \</emph\>A numeric expression that marks the position in a string where the search for the specified substring starts. If you omit this parameter, the search starts at the first character of the string. The maximum allowed value is 65535.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120401.xhp	0	help	par_id3145609				0	et	\<emph\>Text1:\</emph\> Stringavaldis, mille seest otsitakse.				20200411 15:09:53
