helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080104.xhp	0	help	par_id3148663				0	et	Determines the tangent of an angle. The angle is specified in radians.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080104.xhp	0	help	par_id3153379				0	et	Using the angle Alpha, the Tan Function calculates the ratio of the length of the side opposite the angle to the length of the side adjacent to the angle in a right-angled triangle.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080104.xhp	0	help	par_id3154366				0	et	Tan(alfa) = nurga vastaskaatet/nurga lähiskaatet				20200411 15:09:53
