helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120101.xhp	0	help	par_id3145609				0	et	Use the Asc function to replace keys with values. If the Asc function encounters a blank string, $[officename] Basic reports a run-time error. In addition to 7 bit ASCII characters (Codes 0-127), the ASCII function can also detect non-printable key codes in ASCII code. This function can also handle 16 bit unicode characters.				20200411 15:09:53
