helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03060100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148946				0	et	Parameetrid:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03060100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149457				0	et	\<emph\>Result:\</emph\> Any numeric variable that records the result of the combination.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03060100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150541				0	et	\<emph\>Expression1, Expression2:\</emph\> Any expressions that you want to combine.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03060100.xhp	0	help	par_id3156215				0	et	Boolean expressions combined with AND only return the value \<emph\>True\</emph\> if both expressions evaluate to \<emph\>True\</emph\>:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03060100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150870				0	et	\<emph\>True\</emph\> AND \<emph\>True\</emph\> returns \<emph\>True\</emph\>; for all other combinations the result is \<emph\>False\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03060100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153768				0	et	The AND operator also performs a bitwise comparison of identically positioned bits in two numeric expressions.				20200411 15:09:53
