helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120202.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147291				0	et	\<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/03120202.xhp\" name=\"String funktsioon [Käitusaeg]\"\>String funktsioon [Käitusaeg]\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120202.xhp	0	help	par_id3147242				0	et	Creates a string according to the specified character, or the first character of a string expression that is passed to the function.				20200411 15:09:53
