helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01020100.xhp	0	help	par_id3152869				0	et	OPTION EXPLICIT				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01020100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155072				0	et	The \<emph\>Option Explicit\</emph\> statement has to be the first line in the module, before the first SUB. Generally, only arrays need to be declared explicitly. All other variables are declared according to the type-declaration character, or - if omitted - as the default type \<emph\>Single\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
