helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170100.xhp	0	help	par_id3156422				0	et	As with list boxes or combo boxes, you can open or close the list with a mouse click at the arrow on the right end of the field. However, the input here can be entered either in the opened list or in the top text field. An exception is the properties that expect a list representation, for example, the property \<emph\>List Entries\</emph\>, which can be set for the control fields \<emph\>List Box\</emph\> and \<emph\>Combo Box\</emph\>. Here, you can only edit the entries when the field is opened.				20200411 15:09:53
