helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3148539				0	et	Your search terms will be saved as long as the table or the formula document is open. If you are running more than one search and you would like to repeat the search term, you can select a previously used search term from the combo box.				20200411 15:09:53
