helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3153418				0	et	"2" is returned, but not "Feb".				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3151321				0	et	It is recommended that you always search using field formatting.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3149401				0	et	The following examples show possible issues when searching without field formatting. These issues depend on the database used and only occur for certain internal default formatting:				20200411 15:09:53
