helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\stars.xhp	0	help	par_idN10594				0	et	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Klõpsa tähtede tööriistariba ikoonil ja lohista hiirega dokumendis kujundi paigutamiseks.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\stars.xhp	0	help	par_idN10597				0	et	Mõnel kujundil on eriotstarbeline pide, millest lohistamisel muutuvad kujundi omadused. Hiirekursor muutub sellise pideme kohal käekujuliseks.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170903.xhp	0	help	tit				0	et	List Box Wizard: Field Link				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170903.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149119				0	et	\<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170903.xhp\" name=\"List Box Wizard: Field Link\"\>List Box Wizard: Field Link\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170903.xhp	0	help	par_id3159224				0	et	Indicates through which fields tables of values and list tables are linked.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170903.xhp	0	help	par_id3150499				0	et	The value table is the table of the current form where the list field is inserted. The list table is the table whose data is to be shown in the list field. Both tables must be linked over a mutual data field. These links are to be entered on this page of the wizard. The field names must not necessarily be the same (this depends upon how the field names are defined in both tables), but both fields must have the same field type.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170903.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149180				0	et	Value table field				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170903.xhp	0	help	par_id3150789				0	et	\<ahelp hid=\"DBP_COMBOBOX_RID_PAGE_LCW_FIELDLINK_CMB_VALUELISTFIELD\"\>Specifies the current form data field which should be related to a field in the linked table.\</ahelp\> In addition, click the desired data field in the list field below.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170903.xhp	0	help	par_id3145669				0	et	In \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170102.xhp\" name=\"Control - Properties\"\>Control - Properties\</link\>, the specified field will appear as an entry in the \<emph\>Data\</emph\> tab page under \<emph\>Data field\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170903.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149827				0	et	List table field				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170903.xhp	0	help	par_id3155391				0	et	\<ahelp hid=\"DBP_COMBOBOX_RID_PAGE_LCW_FIELDLINK_CMB_TABLEFIELD\"\>Specifies the linked table data field, which is related to the specified value table field.\</ahelp\> In addition, click the data field in the lower list field.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170903.xhp	0	help	par_id3154823				0	et	In \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170102.xhp\" name=\"Control - Properties\"\>Control - Properties\</link\>, the specified field will appear in the \<emph\>Data\</emph\> tab page of a SQL statement under \<emph\>List Contents\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
