helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3155096	86			0	et	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_VALUESTEP\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Determines spin button intervals.\</ahelp\>You can preset the value intervals for numerical and currency spin buttons. Use the up and down arrows of the spin button to increase or decrease the value.				20200411 15:09:53
