helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3153813				0	et	If the control is linked to a database and the text length is to be accepted from the field definition of the database, you must not enter the text length here. The settings are only accepted from the database if the control property was not defined ("Not Defined" state).				20200411 15:09:53
