helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170600.xhp	0	help	par_id3149766				0	et	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:ShowPropertyBrowser\"\>Starts the \<emph\>Properties\</emph\> dialog for the selected entry.\</ahelp\> If a form is selected, the \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170200.xhp\" name=\"Form Properties\"\>Form Properties\</link\> dialog opens. If a control is selected, the \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170100.xhp\" name=\"Control Properties\"\>Control Properties\</link\> dialog opens.				20200411 15:09:53
