helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000208.xhp	0	help	par_id314995711				0	et	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>When this option is enabled, fields or cells whose values are quoted in their entirety (the first and last characters of the value equal the text delimiter) are imported as text.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
