helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01110100.xhp	0	help	par_id3163829				0	et	On the first page you can select an existing design or create a new one.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01110100.xhp	0	help	par_id3152363				0	et	The settings you select for the export will be automatically saved as a design for other exports. You can enter the design name after clicking \<emph\>Create\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
