helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\floating_toolbar.xhp	0	help	par_id9776909				0	et	While the toolbar is visible, choose \<emph\>View - Toolbars\</emph\> and click the name of the toolbar to remove the check mark.				20200411 15:09:53
