helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\sidebar_window.xhp	0	help	par_id2016				0	et	The \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Slide Transition\</item\> deck provides tools to apply a special effect that plays when you display a slide. This deck is only available for presentations.				20200411 15:09:53
