helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\digitalsign_receive.xhp	0	help	par_id1399578				0	et	%PRODUCTNAME-is saab avada ja salvestada WebDAV-serveris asuvaid dokumente kasutades turvalist HTTPS-protokolli.				20200411 15:09:53
