helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\scripting.xhp	0	help	par_idN10770				0	et	A list of the script functions appears in the \<emph\>Commands\</emph\> list box. Select a function.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\scripting.xhp	0	help	par_idN10778				0	et	Click \<emph\>Add\</emph\> to create a new menu assignment. The new menu entry appears in the \<emph\>Entries\</emph\> list box.				20200411 15:09:53
