helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154479				0	et	Objektide valimine				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3148993				0	et	Press Shift+F4 to select the first object in the current document. When an object is selected, press Tab to select the next object, or press Esc to go back to the text.				20200411 15:09:53
