helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\dragdrop_beamer.xhp	0	help	par_id3147335				0	et	\<image id=\"img_id3155390\" src=\"res/helpimg/copydata.png\" width=\"8.47mm\" height=\"8.47mm\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3155390\"\>Hiirekursor andmete kopeerimisel\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
