helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147285				0	et	Abimees				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	par_id3149716				0	et	\<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01010600.xhp\" name=\"Abimees\"\>Abimees\</link\> käivitub automaatselt, kui sa teed midagi, mis võiks abi vajada. Abimees ilmub väikese aknana dokumendi nurka. Et näha tegevuse abiinfot, klõpsa Abimehe aknas.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	par_idN10634				0	et	The Help Agent automatically closes after a short delay. If you ignore or close the Help Agent three times you perform a certain task, the Help Agent no longer opens for that task. To disable the Help Agent choose \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>\<emph\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</emph\>\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>\<emph\>Tools - Options\</emph\>\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>\<emph\> - %PRODUCTNAME - General\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
