helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010200.xhp	0	help	par_id3154123				0	et	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_CHECKBOX_RID_SFXPAGE_SAVE_BTN_BACKUP\"\>Igal salvestamisel salvestatakse dokumendi eelnev versioon varukoopiana. Iga kord, kui \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> loob uue varukoopia, kustutatakse eelnev. Varukoopia salvestatakse laiendiga .BAK.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010200.xhp	0	help	par_id3153192				0	et	To change the location of the backup copy, choose \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - %PRODUCTNAME - Paths\</emph\>, and then enter a new path for the backup file.				20200411 15:09:53
