helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05030100.xhp	0	help	par_id3158430				0	et	If the fields of the target table have a smaller field length than in the source table when data is being attached, the source data fields will automatically be truncated to match the field lengths in the target table.				20200411 15:09:53
