helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3145375				0	et	GROUP BY				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149438				0	et	Rühmitab päringu andmed vastavalt valitud väljanimele. Funktsioone täidetakse vastavalt määratud rühmadele. SQL-is vastab see valik GROUP BY lõigule. Selle tingimuse lisamisel ilmub see kirje SQL HAVING sektsioonis.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3156038				0	et	Funktsioone on võimalik ka otse SQL-lauses välja kutsuda. Süntaks on:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3156340				0	et	SELECT FUNKTSIOON(veerg) FROM tabel.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155075				0	et	Näiteks summa arvutamise funktsiooni väljakutsumine SQL-käsus on järgmine:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154591				0	et	SELECT SUM("Hind") FROM "Artikkel".				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3159205				0	et	Except for the \<emph\>Group\</emph\> function, the above functions are so-called Aggregate functions. These are functions that calculate data to create summaries from the results. Additional functions that are not listed in the list box might be also possible. These depend on the specific database system in use and on the current state of the Base driver.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3148651				0	et	To use other functions not listed in the list box, you must enter them under \<emph\>Field\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155098				0	et	You can also assign aliases to function calls. If the query is not to be displayed in the column header, enter the desired name under \<emph\>Alias\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155539				0	et	Vastav funktsioon SQL lauses on:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149425				0	et	SELECT FUNCTION() AS alias FROM tabel				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3144431				0	et	Näide:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154614				0	et	SELECT COUNT(*) AS count FROM "Artikkel"				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154610				0	et	If you run this function, you cannot insert any additional columns for the query other than receiving these columns as a "Group" function.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154644				0	et	\<emph\>Näited\</emph\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3151120				0	et	Järgnevas näites käivitatakse päring üle kahe tabeli: tabel "Kaup", milles on väli "Kauba_Nr" ja tabel "Tarnija", milles on väli "Tarnija_Nimi". Lisaks on mõlemas tabelis ühine väli "Tarnija_Nr".				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155144				0	et	Selleks, et luua päring, mis sisaldab kõiki varustajaid, kes tarnivad rohkem kui kolme kaupa, peab läbima järgmised sammud.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153240				0	et	Lisa päringu koostamisse tabelid "Kaup" ja "Tarnija".				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3148807				0	et	Seosta omavahel kahe tabeli "Tarnija_Nr" väljad, kui sellist seost veel ei ole.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3161652				0	et	Tabelis "Kaup" tee topeltklõps väljal "Kauba_Nr". Ava kontekstimenüü, vali käsk \<emph\>Funktsioon\</emph\> ning vali funktsioon Count.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3151009				0	et	Sisesta kriteeriumiks >3 ning keela väli Nähtav.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3145601				0	et	Tabelis "Tarnija" tee topelklõps väljal "Tarnija_Nimi" ning vali funktsioon Group.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3147512				0	et	Käivita päring.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3148638				0	et	Kui tabelis "Kaup" on olemas väljad "Hind" (iga artikli konkreetne hind) ning "Tarnija_Nr" (vastava artikli tarnija), siis võid saada artikli keskmise hinna varustaja kohta järgmise päringuga:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153045				0	et	Lisa tabel "Kaup" päringu koostamisse.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149802				0	et	Tee väljadel "Hind" ja "Tarnija_Nr" topeltklõps.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153554				0	et	Enable the \<emph\>Function\</emph\> line and select the Average function from the "Price" field.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155597				0	et	You can also enter "Average" in the line for the alias name (without quotation marks).				20200411 15:09:53
