helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05020100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153140	22			0	et	When you delete a primary key field with the\<emph\> Delete cascade \</emph\>option, all records from other tables that have this key as their foreign key are also deleted. Use this option with great care; it is possible that a major portion of the database can be deleted.				20200411 15:09:53
