helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05000001.xhp	0	help	par_id3163829				0	et	The context menu of the table container offers various functions that apply to all database tables. To edit a special table within the database, select the corresponding table and open its context menu.				20200411 15:09:53
