helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\11080000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153087				0	et	For example, for a "Bibliography" data source, you can enter the following SQL command:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\11080000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145673				0	et	SELECT "Address" FROM "biblio" "biblio"				20200411 15:09:53
