helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\02090000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148488				0	et	"Markerid" on kohahoidjad. Need on <?> kujuga \<emph\>Konsooliaknas\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03091200.xhp	0	help	tit				0	et	Indeksid ja astendajad				20200411 15:09:53
