helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\table_view.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147304				0	et	\<variable id=\"table_view\"\>\<link href=\"text/scalc/guide/table_view.xhp\" name=\"Arvutustabeli vaate muutmine\"\>Arvutustabeli vaate muutmine\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\table_view.xhp	0	help	par_id3153192				0	et	Rea- ja veerupäiste püsivaks peitmiseks arvutustabelis:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\table_view.xhp	0	help	par_id3153768				0	et	Under the menu item \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - %PRODUCTNAME Calc,\</emph\> go to the \<emph\>View\</emph\> tab page. Unmark\<emph\> Column/row headers\</emph\>. Confirm with \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
