helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\print_title_row.xhp	0	help	tit				0	et	Ridade või veergude kordamine printimisel				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\print_title_row.xhp	0	help	bm_id3151112				0	et	\<bookmark_value\>printimine; arvutustabel mitmele lehele\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>arvutustabelid; printimine mitmele lehele\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>read; kordamine printimisel\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>veerud; kordamine printimisel\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>kordamine; veerud või read prinditud lehtedel\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>päiseread; printimine kõikidele lahtedele\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>päised; printimine lehtedele\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>jalused; printimine lehtedele\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>printimine; read või veerud tabeli päistena\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>pealkirjad; korduvad read või veerud pealkirjadena\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\print_title_row.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153727				0	et	\<variable id=\"print_title_row\"\>\<link href=\"text/scalc/guide/print_title_row.xhp\" name=\"Ridade või veergude kordamine printimisel\"\>Ridade või veergude kordamine printimisel\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\print_title_row.xhp	0	help	par_id3154014				0	et	If you have a sheet that is so large that it will be printed multiple pages, you can set up rows or columns to repeat on each printed page.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\print_title_row.xhp	0	help	par_id3146975				0	et	As an example, If you want to print the top two rows of the sheet as well as the first column (A)on all pages, do the following:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\print_title_row.xhp	0	help	par_id3163710				0	et	Vali \<emph\>Vormindus - Trükialad - Redigeeri\</emph\>. Ilmub dialoog \<emph\>Trükialade redigeerimine\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\print_title_row.xhp	0	help	par_id3149958				0	et	Click the icon at the far right of the \<emph\>Rows to repeat\</emph\> area.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\print_title_row.xhp	0	help	par_id3145800				0	et	Dialoogi kahandatakse nii, et sa näed suuremat lehe ala.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\print_title_row.xhp	0	help	par_id3155602				0	et	Vali selle näite puhul esimesed kaks rida, klõpsa lahtril A1 ja lohista see lahtrile A2.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\print_title_row.xhp	0	help	par_id3154018				0	et	Kahandatud dialoogis näed sa $1:$2. Read 1 ja 2 on nüüd korratavad read.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\print_title_row.xhp	0	help	par_id3153707				0	et	Click the icon at the far right of the \<emph\>Rows to repeat\</emph\> area. The dialog is restored again.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\print_title_row.xhp	0	help	par_id3155443				0	et	If you also want column A as a column to repeat, click the icon at the far right of the \<emph\>Columns to repeat\</emph\> area.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\print_title_row.xhp	0	help	par_id3154256				0	et	Klõpsa veerul A (mitte veerupäisel).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\print_title_row.xhp	0	help	par_id3154704				0	et	Click the icon again at the far right of the \<emph\>Columns to repeat\</emph\> area.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\print_title_row.xhp	0	help	par_id3150088				0	et	Rows to repeat are rows from the sheet. You can define headers and footers to be printed on each print page independently of this in \<emph\>Format - Page\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\print_title_row.xhp	0	help	par_id3155380				0	et	\<link href=\"text/scalc/01/03100000.xhp\" name=\"View - Page Break Preview\"\>Vaade - Vaade lehepiiridega\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
