helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\row_height.xhp	0	help	par_id3154702				0	et	What is described here for rows and row height applies accordingly for columns and column width.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\row_height.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153963				0	et	Rea kõrguse või veeru laiuse muutmine hiirega				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\row_height.xhp	0	help	par_id3154020				0	et	Click the area of the headers on the separator below the current row, keep the mouse button pressed and drag up or down in order to change the row height.				20200411 15:09:53
