helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\printranges.xhp	0	help	par_id3151075				0	et	To delete a manual page break that is contained in a print range, drag the border of the page break outside of the print range.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\printranges.xhp	0	help	par_idN10948				0	et	To clear a print range, drag a border of the range onto the opposite border of the range.				20200411 15:09:53
