helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cell_unprotect.xhp	0	help	par_id3151112				0	et	Vali leht, mille kaitset soovid tühistada.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cell_unprotect.xhp	0	help	par_id3149656				0	et	Select \<emph\>Tools - Protect Document\</emph\>, then choose \<emph\>Sheet\</emph\> or \<emph\>Document\</emph\> to remove the check mark indicating the protected status.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cell_unprotect.xhp	0	help	par_id3145171				0	et	If you have assigned a password, enter it in this dialog and click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\cell_unprotect.xhp	0	help	par_id3153771				0	et	Lahtreid saab nüüd redigeerida ja neis sisalduvaid valemeid vaadata ning kõik lahtrid prinditakse seni, kuni lehe või dokumendi kaitse pole taastatud.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\autofilter.xhp	0	help	tit				0	et	Automaatfiltri rakendamine				20200411 15:09:53
