helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\scenario.xhp	0	help	bm_id3149664				0	et	\<bookmark_value\>stsenaariumid; loomine, redigeerimine, kustutamine\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>avamine; stsenaariumid\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>valimine; stsenaariumid Navigaatoris\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\scenario.xhp	0	help	hd_id3125863				0	et	\<variable id=\"scenario\"\>\<link href=\"text/scalc/guide/scenario.xhp\" name=\"Stsenaariumide kasutamine\"\>Stsenaariumide kasutamine\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\scenario.xhp	0	help	par_id3150869				0	et	A $[officename] Calc scenario is a set of cell values that can be used within your calculations. You assign a name to every scenario on your sheet. Define several scenarios on the same sheet, each with some different values in the cells. Then you can easily switch the sets of cell values by their name and immediately observe the results. Scenarios are a tool to test out "what-if" questions.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\scenario.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149255				0	et	Oma stsenaariumide loomine				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\scenario.xhp	0	help	par_id3154704	16			0	et	Stsenaariumi loomiseks vali kõik lahtrid, mis varustavad stsenaariumi andmetega.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\scenario.xhp	0	help	par_id3154020				0	et	Vali lahtrid, mis sisaldavad erinevate stsenaariumide puhul muutuvaid väärtusi. Mitme lahtri valimiseks hoia lahtritel klõpsamise ajal all klahvi \<item type=\"keycode\"\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\scenario.xhp	0	help	par_id3150364				0	et	Vali \<emph\>Tööriistad - Stsenaariumid\</emph\>. Avaneb dialoog \<emph\>Stsenaariumi loomine\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\scenario.xhp	0	help	par_id3166426				0	et	Enter a name for the new scenario and leave the other fields unchanged with their default values. Close the dialog with OK. Your new scenario is automatically activated.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\scenario.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149664				0	et	Stsenaariumide kasutamine				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\scenario.xhp	0	help	par_id3153415				0	et	Stsenaariume saab valida Navigaatoris:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\scenario.xhp	0	help	par_id3150752	12			0	et	Ava navigaator standardribal asuva \<emph\>Navigaatori\</emph\> ikooni \<image id=\"img_id1593676\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_navigator.png\" width=\"0.1665inch\" height=\"0.1665inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id1593676\"\>Navigaatori ikoon\</alt\>\</image\> abil.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\scenario.xhp	0	help	par_id3155764	13			0	et	Klõpsa navigaatoris \<emph\>stsenaariumide\</emph\> ikoonil \<image id=\"img_id7617114\" src=\"sc/res/imglst/navipi/na07.png\" width=\"0.222inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id7617114\"\>Stsenaariumide ikoon\</alt\>\</image\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\scenario.xhp	0	help	par_id3154256				0	et	Navigaatoris näed sa määratud stsenaariume koos nende loomise ajal sisestatud märkustega.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\scenario.xhp	0	help	par_id1243629				0	et	Stsenaariumi rakendamiseks aktiivsele lehele tee Navigatoris stsenaariumi nimel topeltklõps.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\scenario.xhp	0	help	par_id9044770				0	et	Stsenaariumi kustutamiseks klõpsa parempoolse klahviga nimel navigaatoris ja vali \<emph\>Kustuta\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\scenario.xhp	0	help	par_id3674123				0	et	Stsenaariumi redigeerimiseks klõpsa parempoolse klahviga nimel navigaatoris ja vali \<emph\>Omadused\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\scenario.xhp	0	help	par_id3424481				0	et	To hide the border of a set of cells that are part of a scenario, open the \<emph\>Properties\</emph\> dialog for each scenario that affects the cells and clear the Display border checkbox. Hiding the border also removes the listbox on the sheet where you can choose the scenarios.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\scenario.xhp	0	help	par_id3154368				0	et	If you want to know which values in the scenario affect other values, choose \<emph\>Tools - Detective - Trace Dependents\</emph\>. You see arrows to the cells that are directly dependent on the current cell.				20200411 15:09:53
