helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN1070F				0	et	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>For each data field, you can select the type of display.\</ahelp\> For some types you can select additional information for a base field and a base item.				20200411 15:09:53
