helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	par_id3144758	132			0	et	            \<emph\>Values\</emph\> represents an array containing the values.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	par_id3149233	133			0	et	            \<emph\>Guess\</emph\> (optional) is the estimated value. An iterative method is used to calculate the internal rate of return. If you can provide only few values, you should provide an initial guess to enable the iteration.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151258				0	et	Näide				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	par_id3150630				0	et	Eeldades, et lahtrid sisuks on A1=\<item type=\"input\"\>-10000\</item\>, A2=\<item type=\"input\"\>3500\</item\>, A3=\<item type=\"input\"\>7600\</item\> ja A4=\<item type=\"input\"\>1000\</item\>, tagastab valem \<item type=\"input\"\>=IRR(A1:A4)\</item\> tulemuse 11,33%.				20200411 15:09:53
