helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	par_id3148672	318			0	et	            \<emph\>Rate\</emph\> sets the periodic interest rate.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	par_id3145777	319			0	et	            \<emph\>Period\</emph\> is the number of installments for calculation of interest.				20200411 15:09:53
