helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060181.xhp	0	help	par_id3154633				0	et	What is the probability with ten throws of the dice, that a six will come up exactly twice? The probability of a six (or any other number) is 1/6. The following formula combines these factors:				20200411 15:09:53
