helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_idN115A5				0	et	\<embedvar href=\"text/scalc/00/00000004.xhp#moreontop\"/\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159352				0	et	Näide				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3159366				0	et	In the spreadsheet, select the range in which the transposed array can appear. If the original array has n rows and m columns, your selected range must have at least m rows and n columns. Then enter the formula directly, select the original array and press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Shift+Command+Enter\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Shift+Ctrl+Enter\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>. Or, if you are using the \<emph\>Function Wizard\</emph\>, mark the \<emph\>Array\</emph\> check box. The transposed array appears in the selected target range and is protected automatically against changes.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	bm_id3109846				0	et	\<bookmark_value\>LINEST funktsioon\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	hd_id3109846				0	et	LINEST				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3144733				0	et	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_RGP\"\>Tagastab andmehulgaga kõige paremini sobiva sirgjoone statistika tabeli.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152825				0	et	Süntaks				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3152839				0	et	LINEST(Y_andmed; X_andmed; vabaliige; statistika)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3152853				0	et	\<emph\>Andmed_Y\</emph\> on andmepunktide hulga y-koordinaate määrav üksik rida või veergude vahemik.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3154428				0	et	\<emph\>data_X\</emph\> is a corresponding single row or column range specifying the x coordinates. If \<emph\>data_X\</emph\> is omitted it defaults to \<item type=\"literal\"\>1, 2, 3, ..., n\</item\>. If there is more than one set of variables \<emph\>data_X\</emph\> may be a range with corresponding multiple rows or columns.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id0811200804502119				0	et	LINEST finds a straight line \<item type=\"literal\"\>y = a + bx\</item\> that best fits the data, using linear regression (the "least squares" method). With more than one set of variables the straight line is of the form \<item type=\"literal\"\>y = a + b1x1 + b2x2 ... + bnxn\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3154448				0	et	 if\<emph\>linearType\</emph\> is FALSE the straight line found is forced to pass through the origin (the constant a is zero; y = bx). If omitted, \<emph\>linearType\</emph\> defaults to TRUE (the line is not forced through the origin).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3154142				0	et	if\<emph\>stats\</emph\> is omitted or FALSE only the top line of the statistics table is returned. If TRUE the entire table is returned.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id0811200804502261				0	et	LINEST tagastab statistika tabeli (massiivi), nagu allpool näidatud ja see tuleb sisestada masiivi valemina (näiteks klahvide \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Shift+Return abil tavapärase Return'i asemel).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_idN11416				0	et	\<embedvar href=\"text/scalc/00/00000004.xhp#optional\"/\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_idN116C6				0	et	\<embedvar href=\"text/scalc/00/00000004.xhp#moreontop\"/\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154162				0	et	Näide				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3154176				0	et	See funktsioon tagastab massiivi ja seda kasutatakse sarnaselt teiste massiivi funktsioonidega. Vali esmalt tulemuste vahemik ja seejärel funktsioon. Vali \<emph\>Y_andmed\</emph\>. Soovi korral võid sisestada muid argumente. Vali \<emph\>Massiiv\</emph\> ja klõpsa \<emph\>Sobib\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3155468				0	et	Tulemusena tagastatakse vähemalt (kui \<emph\>statistika\</emph\> = 0) regressioonijoone kalle ja joone lõikepunkt Y-teljega. Kui \<emph\>statistika\</emph\> ei ole 0, kuvatakse ka teisi tulemusi.				20200411 15:09:53
