helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_date.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155511				0	et	\<variable id=\"date\"\>\<link href=\"text/scalc/01/func_date.xhp\"\>DATE\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_date.xhp	0	help	par_id3153551				0	et	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_DATUM\"\>This function calculates a date specified by year, month, day and displays it in the cell's formatting.\</ahelp\> The default format of a cell containing the DATE function is the date format, but you can format the cells with any other number format.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_date.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148590				0	et	Süntaks				20200411 15:09:53
