helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_date.xhp	0	help	par_id3152815				0	et	\<emph\>Aasta\</emph\> on täisarv vahemikus 1583 kuni 9957 või 0 kuni 99.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_date.xhp	0	help	par_id3153222				0	et	In \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - $[officename] - General \</item\>you can set from which year a two-digit number entry is recognized as 20xx.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_date.xhp	0	help	par_id3155817				0	et	\<emph\>Kuu\</emph\> on kuud tähistav täisarv.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_date.xhp	0	help	par_id3153183				0	et	\<emph\>Päev\</emph\> on kuupäeva tähistav täisarv.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_date.xhp	0	help	par_id3156260				0	et	If the values for month and day are out of bounds, they are carried over to the next digit. If you enter \<item type=\"input\"\>=DATE(00;12;31)\</item\> the result will be 12/31/00. If, on the other hand, you enter \<item type=\"input\"\>=DATE(00;13;31)\</item\> the result will be 1/31/01.				20200411 15:09:53
