helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060112.xhp	0	help	par_id3159119				0	et	Input: Any number of types (double&, char*, double*, char**, Cell area), where the \<link href=\"text/scalc/01/04060112.xhp\" name=\"Cell area\"\>Cell area\</link\> is an array of types double array, string array, or cell array.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060112.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150653				0	et	GetFunctionCount()				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060112.xhp	0	help	par_id3152981				0	et	Returns the number of functions without the management functions of the reference parameter. Each function has a unique number between 0 and nCount-1. This number will be needed for the \<link href=\"text/scalc/01/04060112.xhp\" name=\"GetFunctionData\"\>GetFunctionData\</link\> and \<link href=\"text/scalc/01/04060112.xhp\" name=\"GetParameterDescription\"\>GetParameterDescription\</link\> functions later.				20200411 15:09:53
