helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060182.xhp	0	help	par_id3150758				0	et	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_GTEST\"\>Calculates the probability of observing a z-statistic greater than the one computed based on a sample.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
