helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3153049	12			0	et	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_DM\"\>Converts a number to an amount in the currency format, rounded to a specified decimal place.\</ahelp\> In the \<item type=\"literal\"\>Value\</item\> field enter the number to be converted to currency. Optionally, you may enter the number of decimal places in the \<item type=\"literal\"\>Decimals\</item\> field. If no value is specified, all numbers in currency format will be displayed with two decimal places. 				20200411 15:09:53
