helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060185.xhp	0	help	par_id3158436	180			0	et	            \<emph\>Alpha \</emph\>is the shape parameter of the Weibull distribution.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060185.xhp	0	help	par_id3154668	181			0	et	            \<emph\>Beta\</emph\> is the scale parameter of the Weibull distribution.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060185.xhp	0	help	par_id3154825	182			0	et	            \<emph\>C\</emph\> indicates the type of function.				20200411 15:09:53
