helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3155991				0	et	\<item type=\"input\"\>=VDB(35000;7500;36;10;20;2)\</item\> = 8603.80 currency units. The depreciation during the period between the 10th and the 20th period is 8,603.80 currency units.				20200411 15:09:53
