helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3150816				0	et	\<item type=\"literal\"\>TRUNC(Number; 0)\</item\> behaves as \<item type=\"literal\"\>INT(Number)\</item\> for positive numbers, but effectively rounds towards zero for negative numbers.				20200411 15:09:53
