helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3151740				0	et	\<item type=\"input\"\>=SUM(A1;A3;B5)\</item\> calculates the sum of the three cells. \<item type=\"input\"\>=SUM (A1:E10)\</item\> calculates the sum of all cells in the A1 to E10 cell range.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3151756				0	et	Funktsiooni AND sisaldavaid tingimusi saab kasutada koos funktsiooniga SUM() järgneval viisil:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3151774				0	et	Näiteülesanne: Sa sisestasid tabelisse arved. Veerg A sisaldab arvete kuupäevi, veerg B arvete summasid. Vaja on kirjutada valem, mille abil saaks leida teatud ajavahemikul väljastatud arvete kogusumma, näiteks perioodi, mis vastab tingimusele >=01.01.2008 ja <01.02.2008. Kuupäevaväärtused paiknevad vahemikus A1:A40, liidetavad arvud paiknevad vahemikus B1:B40. C1 sisaldab kaasatavate arvete alguskuupäeva, 2008\<item type=\"input\"\>01.01\</item\>, ja C2 kuupäeva \<item type=\"input\"\>01.02\</item\>, mis jäetakse esimesena välja.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3151799				0	et	Sisestame massiivi valemina järgmise valemi:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3151813				0	et	\<item type=\"input\"\>=SUM((A1:A40>=C1)*(A1:A40<C2)*B1:B40)\</item\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3151828				0	et	In order to enter this as an array formula, you must press the Shift\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>+Command \</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>+ Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+ Enter keys instead of simply pressing the Enter key to close the formula. The formula will then be shown in the \<emph\>Formula\</emph\> bar enclosed in braces.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3151869				0	et	{=SUM((A1:A40>=C1)*(A1:A40<C2)*B1:B40)}				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3151884				0	et	Valem rajaneb põhimõttel, et kui tingimus on rahuldatud, on võrdluse tulemuseks 1, ja kui mitte, siis 0. Võrdluste tulemuste hulka käsitletakse massiivina ja seda kasutatakse maatrikskorrutises, mille vastuse elemendid lõpptulemuse saamiseks liidetakse.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	bm_id3151957				0	et	\<bookmark_value\>SUMIF function\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>adding;specified numbers\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151957				0	et	SUMIF				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3151986				0	et	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_SUMMEWENN\"\>Liidab antud kriteeriumitega määratud lahtrid.\</ahelp\> Funktsiooni kasutatakse soovitud väärtuste leidmiseks vahemikus.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152015				0	et	Süntaks				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3152028				0	et	SUMIF(vahemik; kriteeriumid; summa_vahemik)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3152043				0	et	\<emph\>Range\</emph\> is the range to which the criteria are to be applied.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3152062				0	et	\<emph\>Criteria\</emph\> is the cell in which the search criterion is shown, or the search criterion itself. If the criteria is written into the formula, it has to be surrounded by double quotes.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3152083				0	et	\<emph\>SumRange\</emph\> is the range from which values are summed. If this parameter has not been indicated, the values found in the Range are summed.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id8347422				0	et	SUMIF toetab viidete liitmise tehet (~) ainult kriteeriumite parameetris ning ainult juhul, kui mittekohustuslik summa vahemiku parameeter puudub.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152110				0	et	Näide				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3152148				0	et	To sum up only negative numbers: \<item type=\"input\"\>=SUMIF(A1:A10;"<0")\</item\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id6670125				0	et	\<item type=\"input\"\>=SUMIF(A1:A10;">0";B1:10)\</item\> - sums values from the range B1:B10 only if the corresponding values in the range A1:A10 are >0.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id6062196				0	et	Funktsiooni COUNTIF() juures on toodud teisigi süntaksinäiteid, mida saab kasutada koos funktsiooniga SUMIF().				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	bm_id3151957K				0	et	\<bookmark_value\>SUMIFS function\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>adding;specified numbers\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151957K				0	et	SUMIFS				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3151986K				0	et	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_SUMMEWNRNG\"\>Sum the values of cells in a range that meet multiple criteria in multiple ranges.\</ahelp\> 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152015K				0	et	Süntaks				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3152028K				0	et	SUMIFS( Reference R ; Reference R1 ; Criterion C1 [ ; Reference R2 ; Criterion C2 ]... )				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3152043K				0	et	Sums the value of cells in range R that meet the Criterion C1 in the reference range R1, and the Criterion C2 in the reference range R2, and so on. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3152062K				0	et	A \<emph\>Criterion\</emph\> is a single cell Reference, Number or Text. If the criterion is written into the formula, it has to be surrounded by double quotes.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3152083K				0	et	All \<emph\>Reference\</emph\> ranges shall have the same dimension and size, else an Error is returned.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152110K				0	et	Näide				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3152148K				0	et	Sum up cells in range A1:10 if the entries in B1:B10 are positive, and the entries in D1:D10 are the letter "A": \<item type=\"input\"\>=SUMIFS(A1:A10;B1:B10;">0";D1:D10;"A")\</item\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id6062196K				0	et	See COUNTIFS() for some more syntax examples that can be used with SUMIFS().				20200411 15:09:53
