helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3143625				0	et	Näide				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3143638				0	et	Sul on tabel, mille lahtrite vahemik A1:B5 sisaldab veerus A linnade nimesid ja veerus B arve. Pärast automaatfiltri kasutamist on nähtavad ainult read, mis sisaldavad linna nime Hamburg. Kui soovid näha ainult kuvatud arvude summat, siis tuleb selleks leida filtreeritud ridade vahekokkuvõte. Antud juhtumi jaoks oleks sobiv valem:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3143658				0	et	\<item type=\"input\"\>=SUBTOTAL(9;B2:B5)\</item\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	bm_id3143672				0	et	\<bookmark_value\>Euro; converting\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>EUROCONVERT function\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3143672				0	et	EUROCONVERT				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3143708				0	et	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_UMRECHNEN\"\>Converts between old European national currency and to and from Euros.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3143731				0	et	\<emph\>Süntaks\</emph\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3143748				0	et	EUROCONVERT(Value; "From_currency"; "To_currency", full_precision, triangulation_precision)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3143763				0	et	\<emph\>Value\</emph\> is the amount of the currency to be converted.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3143782				0	et	\<emph\>From_currency\</emph\> and \<emph\>To_currency\</emph\> are the currency units to convert from and to respectively. These must be text, the official abbreviation for the currency (for example, "EUR"). The rates (shown per Euro) were set by the European Commission.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id0119200904301810				0	et	\<emph\>Full_precision\</emph\> is optional. If omitted or False, the result is rounded according to the decimals of the To currency. If Full_precision is True, the result is not rounded.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id0119200904301815				0	et	\<emph\>Triangulation_precision\</emph\> is optional. If Triangulation_precision is given and >=3, the intermediate result of a triangular conversion (currency1,EUR,currency2) is rounded to that precision. If Triangulation_precision is omitted, the intermediate result is not rounded. Also if To currency is "EUR", Triangulation_precision is used as if triangulation was needed and conversion from EUR to EUR was applied.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3143819				0	et	\<emph\>Examples\</emph\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3143837				0	et	\<item type=\"input\"\>=EUROCONVERT(100;"ATS";"EUR")\</item\> converts 100 Austrian Schillings into Euros.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3143853				0	et	\<item type=\"input\"\>=EUROCONVERT(100;"EUR";"DEM")\</item\> converts 100 Euros into German Marks.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	bm_id0908200902090676				0	et	\<bookmark_value\>CONVERT function\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id0908200902074836				0	et	CONVERT				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id0908200902131122				0	et	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Converts a value from one unit of measurement to another unit of measurement. The conversion factors are given in a list in the configuration.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id0908200902475420				0	et	At one time the list of conversion factors included the legacy European currencies and the Euro (see examples below). We suggest using the new function EUROCONVERT for converting these currencies.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id0908200902131071				0	et	Süntaks				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id0908200902131191				0	et	CONVERT(value;"text";"text")				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id0908200902131152				0	et	Näide				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id090820090213112				0	et	\<item type=\"input\"\>=CONVERT(100;"ATS";"EUR")\</item\> returns the Euro value of 100 Austrian Schillings.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id0908200902475431				0	et	=CONVERT(100;"EUR";"DEM") converts 100 Euros into German Marks. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	bm_id3157177				0	et	\<bookmark_value\>ODD function\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>rounding;up/down to nearest odd integer\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3157177				0	et	ODD				20200411 15:09:53
