helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12060000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152598				0	et	Kastid \<emph\>rida\</emph\> või \<emph\>veerg\</emph\> peavad sisaldama viidet valitud vahemiku esimesele lahtrile.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12060000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154011				0	et	If you export a spreadsheet containing multiple operations to Microsoft Excel, the location of the cells containing the formula must be fully defined relative to the data range.				20200411 15:09:53
