helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3154811				0	et	How high is the periodic monthly payment at an annual interest rate of 8.75% over a period of 3 years? The cash value is 5,000 currency units and is always paid at the beginning of a period. The future value is 8,000 currency units.				20200411 15:09:53
