helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060101.xhp	0	help	par_id3149282				0	et	Valem lahtris B16 on =DCOUNT(A1:E10;0;A13:E14)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060101.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150962				0	et	Andmebaasifunktsiooni argumendid:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060101.xhp	0	help	par_id3155837				0	et	Järgnevas loetelus on kõikide andmebaasifunktsioonide argumentide definitsioonid:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060101.xhp	0	help	par_id3149453				0	et	\<emph\>Database\</emph\> is the cell range defining the database.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060101.xhp	0	help	par_id3151272	86			0	et	\<emph\>DatabaseField\</emph\> specifies the column where the function operates on after the search criteria of the first parameter is applied and the data rows are selected. It is not related to the search criteria itself. Use the number 0 to specify the whole data range. \<variable id=\"quotes\"\>To reference a column by means of the column header name, place quotation marks around the header name. \</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060101.xhp	0	help	par_id3147083				0	et	\<emph\>SearchCriteria\</emph\> is the cell range containing search criteria. If you write several criteria in one row they are connected by AND. If you write the criteria in different rows they are connected by OR. Empty cells in the search criteria range will be ignored.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060101.xhp	0	help	par_id3151188				0	et	Choose \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01060500.xhp\" name=\"Spreadsheet - Calculate\"\>%PRODUCTNAME Calc - Calculate\</link\> to define how $[officename] Calc acts when searching for identical entries.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060101.xhp	0	help	par_id3882869				0	et	Vaata ka Wiki lehekülge \<link href=\"https://wiki.openoffice.org/wiki/Documentation/How_Tos/Conditional_Counting_and_Summation\"\>Tingimuslik loendamine ja liitmine\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060101.xhp	0	help	bm_id3150882				0	et	\<bookmark_value\>DCOUNT function\</bookmark_value\>         \<bookmark_value\>counting rows;with numeric values\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060101.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150882				0	et	DCOUNT				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060101.xhp	0	help	par_id3156133				0	et	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_DBANZAHL\"\>DCOUNT loendab andmebaasi read (kirjed), mis vastavad määratud otsingukriteeriumitele ja sisaldavad arvulisi väärtusi.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060101.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156099				0	et	Süntaks				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060101.xhp	0	help	par_id3153218				0	et	DCOUNT(andmebaas; andmebaasi väli; otsingukriteeriumid)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060101.xhp	0	help	par_id3153273	187			0	et	For the DatabaseField parameter you can enter a cell to specify the column, or enter the number 0 for the entire database. The parameter cannot be empty. \<embedvar href=\"text/scalc/01/04060101.xhp#quotes\"/\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060101.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154743				0	et	Näide				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060101.xhp	0	help	par_id3153623				0	et	Ülaltoodud näite (keri ülespoole, palun) põhjal me tahame teada, kui paljude laste koolitee on pikem kui 600 meetrit. Tulemuse kirjutame lahtrisse B16. Asetame kursori lahtrisse B16. Sisestame lahtrisse B16 valemi \<item type=\"input\"\>=DCOUNT(A1:E10;A1:E10;A13:E14)\</item\>. Dialoog \<emph\>Funktsiooninõustaja\</emph\> on abiks sisendvahemike määramisel.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060101.xhp	0	help	par_id3149142				0	et	\<emph\>Database\</emph\> is the range of data to be evaluated, including its headers: in this case A1:E10. \<emph\>DatabaseField\</emph\> specifies the column for the search criteria: in this case, the whole database. \<emph\>SearchCriteria\</emph\> is the range where you can enter the search parameters: in this case, A13:E14.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060101.xhp	0	help	par_id3145652				0	et	Uurime näiteks, mitu last teises klassis on üle 7 aasta vanad, selleks kustutame kirje >600 lahtris D14 ja sisestame \<item type=\"input\"\>2\</item\> lahtrisse B14, Klassi alla ning sisestame \<item type=\"input\"\>>7\</item\> lahtrisse C14 temast paremal. Vastus on 2. Kaks last on teises klassis ja üle 7 aasta vanad. Kuna mõlemad tingimused on ühes reas, on nad ühendatud loogilise JA-ga.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060101.xhp	0	help	bm_id3156123				0	et	\<bookmark_value\>DCOUNTA function\</bookmark_value\>         \<bookmark_value\>records;counting in Calc databases\</bookmark_value\>         \<bookmark_value\>counting rows;with numeric or alphanumeric values\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060101.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156123				0	et	DCOUNTA				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060101.xhp	0	help	par_id3156110				0	et	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_DBANZAHL2\"\>DCOUNTA loendab andmebaasi read (kirjed), mis vastavad määratud otsingukriteeriumitele ja sisaldavad arvulisi või tähti ja numbreid sisaldavaid väärtusi.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060101.xhp	0	help	hd_id3143228				0	et	Süntaks				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060101.xhp	0	help	par_id3146893				0	et	DCOUNTA(andmebaas; andmebaasi väli; otsingukriteeriumid)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060101.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149751				0	et	Näide				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060101.xhp	0	help	par_id3153982				0	et	In the example above (scroll up, please), you can search for the number of children whose name starts with an E or a subsequent letter. Edit the formula in B16 to read \<item type=\"input\"\>=DCOUNTA(A1:E10;"Name";A13:E14)\</item\>. Delete the old search criteria and enter \<item type=\"input\"\>>=E\</item\> under Name in field A14. The result is 5. If you now delete all number values for Greta in row 8, the result changes to 4. Row 8 is no longer included in the count because it does not contain any values. The name Greta is text, not a value. Note that the DatabaseField parameter must point to a column that can contain values.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060101.xhp	0	help	bm_id3147256				0	et	\<bookmark_value\>DGET function\</bookmark_value\>         \<bookmark_value\>cell contents;searching in Calc databases\</bookmark_value\>         \<bookmark_value\>searching;cell contents in Calc databases\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060101.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147256				0	et	DGET				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060101.xhp	0	help	par_id3152801				0	et	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_DBAUSZUG\"\>DGET tagastab andmebaasi kuuluva viidatud lahtri, mis vastab määratud otsingukriteeriumitele, sisu.\</ahelp\> Vea korral tagastab funktsioon kas #VALUE!, kui ühtegi rida ei leitud, või Err502, kui leiti rohkem kui üks lahter.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060101.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159344				0	et	Süntaks				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060101.xhp	0	help	par_id3154696				0	et	DGET(andmebaas; andmebaasi väli; otsingukriteeriumid)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060101.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153909				0	et	Näide				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060101.xhp	0	help	par_id3155388				0	et	Uurime ülaltoodud näite (keri ülespoole, palun) põhjal, mis klassis käib laps, kelle nimi on lahtris A14. Valemi sisestame jällegi lahtrisse B16 ja see erineb veidike varasematest näidetest, kuna ainult üks veerg (üks andmebaasi väli) tohib olla määratud \<emph\>andmebaasi väljana\</emph\>. Sisestame järgneva valemi:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060101.xhp	0	help	par_id3153096				0	et	\<item type=\"input\"\>=DGET(A1:E10;"Grade";A13:E14)\</item\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060101.xhp	0	help	par_id3150524				0	et	Sisesta nimi \<item type=\"input\"\>Frank\</item\> lahtrisse A14 ja sa näed, et tulemus on 2. Frank on teises klassis. Sisestame "Klass" asemele \<item type=\"input\"\>Vanus\</item\> ja saame vastuseks Franki vanuse.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060101.xhp	0	help	par_id3148833				0	et	Sisestame väärtuse \<item type=\"input\"\>11\</item\> ainult lahtrisse C14 ja kustutame reast kõik ülejäänu. Muudame valemit lahtris B16 järgnevalt:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060101.xhp	0	help	par_id3149912				0	et	\<item type=\"input\"\>=DGET(A1:E10;"Name";A13:E14)\</item\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060101.xhp	0	help	par_id3148813				0	et	Klassi asemel küsime nüüd nime. Vastuseks saamegi Daniel: Daniel on ainus laps vanusega 11 aastat.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060101.xhp	0	help	bm_id3149766				0	et	\<bookmark_value\>DMAX function\</bookmark_value\>         \<bookmark_value\>maximum values in Calc databases\</bookmark_value\>         \<bookmark_value\>searching;maximum values in columns\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060101.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149766				0	et	DMAX				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060101.xhp	0	help	par_id3154903				0	et	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_DBMAX\"\>DMAX tagastab selle andmebaasi (kõikide kirjete hulka) kuuluva ja määratud otsingutingimustele vastava lahtri (välja) sisu, mis on teistega võrreldes suurim.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
