helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\stylist_fillformat.xhp	0	help	par_id3145090	17			0	et	Click the style, and then click the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Fill Format Mode\</item\> icon \<image id=\"img_id3149644\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_fillstyle.png\" width=\"0.1665in\" height=\"0.1665in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3149644\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\> in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Styles and Formatting\</item\> window.				20200411 15:09:53
