helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\references.xhp	0	help	par_id3154256				0	et	In the \<emph\>Selection\</emph\> list, select the target that you want to cross-reference.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\references.xhp	0	help	par_id3154856				0	et	In the \<emph\>Insert reference to\</emph\> list, select the format for the cross-reference. The \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04090002.xhp\" name=\"format\"\>format\</link\> specifies the type of information that is displayed as the cross-reference. For example, "Reference" inserts the target text, and "Page" inserts the page number where the target is located. For footnotes the footnote number is inserted.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\references.xhp	0	help	par_id3155895				0	et	Klõpsa \<emph\>Lisa\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
