helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hidden_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3793450				0	et	You must enable this feature by removing the check mark from menu \<emph\>View - Hidden Paragraphs\</emph\>. When the check mark is set, you cannot hide any paragraph.				20200411 15:09:53
