helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_animation.xhp	0	help	par_id3155178				0	et	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Format - Object - Text Attributes\</item\>, and then click the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Text Animation\</item\> tab.				20200411 15:09:53
