helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_paras.xhp	0	help	par_id3145092				0	et	Võimalik on eemaldada nummerdus numberloendi lõigult, samuti saab muuta numbrit, millega numberloendit alustada.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_paras.xhp	0	help	par_id2172612				0	et	If you want numbered headings, use the \<emph\>Tools - Outline Numbering\</emph\> menu command to assign a numbering to a paragraph style. Do not use the Numbering icon on the Formatting toolbar.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_paras.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145107				0	et	To Remove the Number From a Paragraph in a Numbered List				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_paras.xhp	0	help	par_id3156248				0	et	Klõpsa selle lõigu esimese märgi ees, millelt soovid nummerdust eemaldada.				20200411 15:09:53
