helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\numbering_paras.xhp	0	help	par_id3155895				0	et	Choose \<emph\>Format - Bullets and Numbering\</emph\>, and then click the \<emph\>Options\</emph\> tab.				20200411 15:09:53
