helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_toc.xhp	0	help	par_id3150942				0	et	Kõige mõistlikum viis sisukorra genereerimiseks on eelnevalt määratud pealkirjastiilide, näiteks "Pealkiri 1" rakendamine lõikudele, mida soovid kaasata sisukorda. Pärast stiilide rakendamist saab luua sisukorra.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_toc.xhp	0	help	hd_id5876949				0	et	To Insert a Table of Contents				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_toc.xhp	0	help	par_id3150510				0	et	Klõpsa dokumendis kohale, kuhu soovid sisukorra lisada.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_toc.xhp	0	help	par_id3150528				0	et	Choose \<emph\>Insert - Indexes and Tables - Indexes and Tables\</emph\>, and then click the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04120211.xhp\" name=\"Index/Table\"\>\<emph\>Index/Table\</emph\>\</link\> tab.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_toc.xhp	0	help	par_id3153746				0	et	Select "Table of Contents" in the \<emph\>Type\</emph\> box.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_toc.xhp	0	help	par_id3146856				0	et	Määra kõik vajalikud sätted.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_toc.xhp	0	help	par_id3146872				0	et	Klõpsa \<emph\>Sobib\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_toc.xhp	0	help	par_id3146896				0	et	If you want to use a different paragraph style as a table of contents entry, select the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Additional Styles\</item\> check box in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Create from\</item\> area, and then click the (\<item type=\"menuitem\"\>...\</item\>) button next to the check box. In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Assign Styles\</item\> dialog, click the style in the list, and then click the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>>>\</item\> or the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\><<\</item\> button to define the outline level for the paragraph style.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_toc.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153148				0	et	To Update a Table of Contents				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_toc.xhp	0	help	par_id3153161				0	et	Tee üht järgmistest:				20200411 15:09:53
