helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_frame.xhp	0	help	par_id3149602				0	et	Vali \<emph\>Lisamine - Paneel\</emph\> ja klõpsa Sobib.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_frame.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145115				0	et	To Edit a Text Frame				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_frame.xhp	0	help	par_id3149578				0	et	Tekstipaneeli sisu redigeerimiseks klõpsa paneelis ja tee vajalikud muudatused.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_frame.xhp	0	help	par_id3156239				0	et	To edit a frame, select the frame, right-click, and then choose a formatting option. You can also right-click the selected frame, and choose \<emph\>Frame\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_frame.xhp	0	help	par_id3156261				0	et	To resize a text frame, click an edge of the frame, and drag one of the edges or corners of the frame. Hold down Shift while you drag to maintain the proportion of the frame.				20200411 15:09:53
