helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_frame.xhp	0	help	par_id3154262				0	et	Kõiki Writer'i tekstipaneele võib lasta kuvada teksti vaatamisel ekraanil, kuid varjata need trükkimisel.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_frame.xhp	0	help	par_id3154858				0	et	Vali tekstipaneel (ilmub kaheksa pidet).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_frame.xhp	0	help	par_id3155875				0	et	Choose \<emph\>Format - Frame/Object - Options\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_frame.xhp	0	help	par_id3155899				0	et	In the \<emph\>Properties\</emph\> area, unmark the \<emph\>Print\</emph\> check box and click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_frame.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148701				0	et	To Link Text Frames				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_frame.xhp	0	help	par_id3149986				0	et	Writer'i tekstipaneele saab linkida, et nende sisu liiguks automaatselt ühest paneelist teise.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_frame.xhp	0	help	par_id3153025				0	et	Klõpsa paneeli serval, mida soovid linkida. Paneeli servadele ilmuvad valikupidemed.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_frame.xhp	0	help	par_id3150223	87			0	et	On the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Frame\</item\> Bar, click the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Link Frames\</item\> icon \<image id=\"img_id3148968\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_chainframes.png\" width=\"0.222in\" height=\"0.222in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3148968\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_frame.xhp	0	help	par_id3150930				0	et	Klõpsa paneelil, millega soovid eelmist paneeli linkida.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_frame.xhp	0	help	par_id3150947				0	et	Paneele saab linkida ainult siis, kui:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_frame.xhp	0	help	par_id3150969				0	et	Sihtpaneel on tühi.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_frame.xhp	0	help	par_id3154365				0	et	Sihtpaneel ei ole lingitud ühegi teise paneeliga.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_frame.xhp	0	help	par_id3154383				0	et	Lähte- ja sihtpaneel asuvad ühes sektsioonis. Nii ei saa näiteks linkida päisepaneeli jalusepaneeliga.				20200411 15:09:53
