helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_spellcheck.xhp	0	help	par_id3147282				0	et	Klõpsa menüü avamiseks olekuriba keeleväljal.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_spellcheck.xhp	0	help	par_id3145602				0	et	Choose “None (Do not check spelling)”.				20200411 15:09:53
