helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hyperlinks.xhp	0	help	par_id3155858				0	et	Navigaatori abil saab ristviite dokumenti lisada hüperlingina. Ristviidata saab isegi elemente teistest \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\>-i dokumentidest. Klõpsates \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\>-is avatud dokumendis hüperlingile, saad suunduda viidatud elemendile.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hyperlinks.xhp	0	help	par_id3149833				0	et	Ava dokument või dokumendid, mis sisaldavad elemente, mida soovid viidata.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hyperlinks.xhp	0	help	par_id3148846				0	et	On the Standard bar, click the \<emph\>Navigator\</emph\> icon.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hyperlinks.xhp	0	help	par_id3156108				0	et	Click the arrow next to the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Drag Mode\</item\> icon, and ensure that \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Insert as Hyperlink\</item\> is selected.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\hyperlinks.xhp	0	help	par_id3153396				0	et	Vali Navigaatori allosas paiknevast loendist dokument, mis sisaldab elementi, mida tahad viidata.				20200411 15:09:53
