helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_capital.xhp	0	help	par_id1120200910485775				0	et	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Format - Character\</item\>, click the Font Effects tab, then select the type of capitalization in the Effects box. "Capitals" capitalizes all letters. "Title" capitalizes the first letter of each word. "Small capitals" capitalizes all letters, but in a reduced font size.				20200411 15:09:53
