helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\conditional_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3153185	62			0	et	Meie näite esimeses osas määrame tingimuslause muutuja.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\conditional_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3155566				0	et	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Insert - Fields - Other\</item\>, and then click the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Variables\</item\> tab.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\conditional_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3147759				0	et	Click "Set variable" in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Type\</item\> list.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\conditional_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3147784				0	et	Type a name for the variable in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Name\</item\> box, for example \<item type=\"literal\"\>Reminder\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\conditional_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3147810				0	et	Click "Text" in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Format\</item\> list.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\conditional_text.xhp	0	help	par_id7748344				0	et	Enter \<item type=\"literal\"\>1\</item\> in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Value\</item\> box, and then click \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Insert\</item\>.\<br/\>The Format list now displays a "General" format.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\conditional_text.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145645				0	et	To Define a Condition and the Conditional Text				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\conditional_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3145659				0	et	Näite teises osas tuleb määrata vajalik tingimus ning lisada kohahoidja tingimusliku teksti kuvamiseks dokumendis.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\conditional_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3151193				0	et	Aseta kursor tekstis kohta, kuhu soovid tingimusliku teksti sisestada.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\conditional_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3151212				0	et	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Insert - Fields - Other\</item\>, and then click the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Functions\</item\> tab.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\conditional_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3151250				0	et	Click "Conditional text" in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Type\</item\> list.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\conditional_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3155936				0	et	Type \<item type=\"literal\"\>Reminder EQ "3"\</item\> in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Condition\</item\> box. In other words, the conditional text will be displayed when the variable in the field that you defined in the first part of this example is equal to three.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\conditional_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3155969				0	et	Tingimuse osa "3" ümbritsevad jutumärgid osutavad sellele, et meie näite esimeses osas määratud muutuja on tekstistring.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\conditional_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3150446				0	et	Type the text that you want to display when the condition is met in the \<emph\>Then\</emph\> box. There is almost no limit to the length of the text that you can enter. You can paste a paragraph into this box.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\conditional_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3150473				0	et	Click \<emph\>Insert\</emph\>, and then click \<emph\>Close\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
