helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\conditional_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3155086				0	et	Meie näite korral kuvatakse tingimuslikku teksti juhul, kui tingimusliku muutuja väärtus võrdub 3.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\conditional_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3155110				0	et	Place your cursor in front of the field that you defined in the first part of this example, and then choose \<emph\>Edit - Fields\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\conditional_text.xhp	0	help	par_id3155136				0	et	Replace the number in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Value\</item\> box with 3, and then click \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Close\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
