helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\calculate_clipboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3156366				0	et	If your text already contains a formula, for example "12+24*2", $[officename] can calculate, and then paste the result of the formula in your document, without using the \<emph\>Formula Bar\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
