helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\word_completion_adjust.xhp	0	help	par_id4814294				0	et	If you like it that $[officename] automatically completes the words that you frequently use, you can make further adjustments to refine that behavior. If you want, you can also save the current list of collected words so that it can be used in the next session.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\word_completion_adjust.xhp	0	help	par_id2593462				0	et	To fine-tune the word completion choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Tools – AutoCorrect Options - Word Completion\</item\> and select any of the following options:				20200411 15:09:53
