helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_enter.xhp	0	help	par_id3147409				0	et	Choose \<emph\>Insert - Indexes and Tables - Entry\</emph\>, and do one of the following:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_enter.xhp	0	help	par_id3153417				0	et	To change the text that appears in the index, type the text that you want in the \<emph\>Entry\</emph\> box. The text that you type here does not replace the selected text in the document.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_enter.xhp	0	help	par_id3154258				0	et	To add an index mark to similar words in your document, select \<emph\>Apply to all similar texts\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_enter.xhp	0	help	par_id3155889				0	et	To add the entries to a custom index, click the \<emph\>New User-defined Index\</emph\> icon, enter the name of the index, and then click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_enter.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147119				0	et	To Define Table of Contents Entries				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_enter.xhp	0	help	par_id3147132				0	et	Kõige mõistlikum viis sisukorra genereerimiseks on eelnevalt määratud pealkirjastiilide, näiteks "Pealkiri 1" rakendamine lõikudele, mida soovid kaasata sisukorda.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_enter.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150230				0	et	To Use a Custom Paragraph Style as a Table of Contents Entry				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_enter.xhp	0	help	par_id3150933				0	et	Choose \<emph\>Tools - Outline Numbering\</emph\> and click the \<emph\>Numbering\</emph\> tab.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_enter.xhp	0	help	par_id3150964				0	et	Select the paragraph style that you want to include in your table of contents in the \<emph\>Paragraph Style\</emph\> box.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_enter.xhp	0	help	par_id3150523				0	et	In the \<emph\>Level\</emph\> list, click the hierarchical level that you want to apply the paragraph style to.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_enter.xhp	0	help	par_id3153730	17			0	et	Click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>. You can now apply the style to headings in your document and include them in your table of contents. 				20200411 15:09:53
