helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\border_object.xhp	0	help	par_id3155388				0	et	Vali objekt, millele tahad äärist määrata.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\border_object.xhp	0	help	par_id3149578	4			0	et	Click the \<emph\>Borders\</emph\> icon on the \<emph\>OLE-Object\</emph\> toolbar or \<emph\>Frame\</emph\> toolbar to open the \<emph\>Borders\</emph\> window. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\border_object.xhp	0	help	par_id3159176				0	et	Klõpsa mõnel eelmääratud äärisestiilidest. See asendab objekti aktiivse äärisestiili valitud stiiliga.				20200411 15:09:53
