helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090007.xhp	0	help	par_id3145774				0	et	Kellaaeg on fikseeritud				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090007.xhp	0	help	par_id3155915				0	et	<SDFIELD TYPE=DATETIME SDVAL="35843,4240335648" SDNUM="1031;1031;HH:MM:SS">10:10:36</SDFIELD>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090007.xhp	0	help	par_id3150110				0	et	Kellaaeg on muutuv				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090007.xhp	0	help	par_id3155862				0	et	<SDFIELD TYPE=DATETIME SDNUM="1031;1031;HH:MM:SS">10:10:36</SDFIELD>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090007.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147409				0	et	Dokumendiinfo väljad				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090007.xhp	0	help	par_id3147487				0	et	For DocInformation fields, the TYPE parameter equals DOCINFO. The SUBTYPE parameter displays the specific field type, for example, for the "Created" DocInformation field, SUBTYPE=CREATE. For date and time DocInformation fields, the FORMAT parameter equals DATE or TIME, and the SDNUM parameter indicates the number format that is used. The SDFIXED parameter indicates if the content of the DocInformation field is fixed or not.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090007.xhp	0	help	par_id3147501				0	et	The contents of a fixed date or time field are equal to the SDVAL parameter, otherwise the contents are equal to the text found between the SDFIELD HTML tags.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090007.xhp	0	help	par_id3149562				0	et	Examples of DocInformation special HTML tags that are recognized by $[officename] as fields are shown in the following table:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090007.xhp	0	help	par_id3147738				0	et	Väljad				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090007.xhp	0	help	par_id3146334				0	et	$[officename]-i silt				20200411 15:09:53
