helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120250.xhp	0	help	par_id3153668				0	et	Klõpsa nuppu \<emph\>Fail\</emph\> ja vali seejärel \<emph\>Uus\</emph\> või \<emph\>Redigeeri\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120250.xhp	0	help	par_id3154470	24			0	et	Registrifail sisaldab järgmisi väljasid:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120250.xhp	0	help	par_id3152953				0	et	"Search term" refers to the index entry that you want to mark in the document.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120250.xhp	0	help	par_id3155896				0	et	"Alternative entry" refers to the index entry that you want to appear in the index.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120250.xhp	0	help	par_id3154194				0	et	The 1st and 2nd Keys are parent index entries. The "Search term" or the "Alternative entry" appears as a subentry under the 1st and 2nd Keys.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120250.xhp	0	help	par_id3155184				0	et	"Match case" means that uppercase and lowercase letters are considered.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120250.xhp	0	help	par_id3143282				0	et	"Word only" searches for the term as a single word.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120250.xhp	0	help	par_id3147220				0	et	To enable the "Match case" or "Word only" options, click in the corresponding cell, and then select the check box.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120250.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153629				0	et	Registrifaili loomiseks ilma registrifaili redigeerimise dialoogi abita:				20200411 15:09:53
