helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120250.xhp	0	help	par_id3153354				0	et	Kasuta kirjete jaoks järgnevat vormindust:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120250.xhp	0	help	par_id3149172				0	et	Search term;Alternative entry;1st key;2nd key;Match case;Word only				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120250.xhp	0	help	par_id3156270				0	et	The entries "Match case" and "Word only" are interpreted as "No" or FALSE if they are empty or zero (0). All other contents are interpreted as "Yes" or TRUE.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120250.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145778				0	et	Näide				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120250.xhp	0	help	par_id3155907				0	et	For example, to include the word "Boston" in your alphabetical index under the "Cities" entry, enter the following line in the concordance file:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120250.xhp	0	help	par_id3151370				0	et	Boston;Boston;Linnad;;0;0				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120250.xhp	0	help	par_id3151383				0	et	This also finds "Boston" if it is written in lowercase letters.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120250.xhp	0	help	par_id3155866				0	et	To include the "Beacon Hill" district in Boston under the "Cities" entry, enter the following line:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120250.xhp	0	help	par_id3150116	18			0	et	Beacon Hill;Boston;Linnad;				20200411 15:09:53
