helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05150100.xhp	0	help	par_id3148488				0	et	You can use AutoCorrect to format text documents and plain ASCII text files, but not characters that you have manually formatted. Automatic \<link href=\"text/shared/01/06040100.xhp\" name=\"word completion\"\>word completion\</link\> only occurs after you type a word for the second time in a document.				20200411 15:09:53
