helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154635				0	et	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_MD_GLOS_DEFINE\"\>Creates a new AutoText entry from the selection that you made in the current document. The entry is added to the currently selected AutoText category. You must first enter a name before you see this command.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
